17:42.790 --> 17:44.840
Baliklah berehat kalau kamu penat.

17:45.740 --> 17:47.680
Apa-apa pun, kamu dah nak berkahwin.

17:47.680 --> 17:49.060
Ayah dan Mak He awak

17:49.460 --> 17:51.990
